# Intent
Build the mobile Growth dashboard for an individual goal. It combines daily net
points with an accessible completion/skip history without misleading users by
aggregating unrelated goals.

# Requirements
- Add a selector whenever more than one active or ended goal exists.
- Honor `goalId` in the URL; otherwise default to newest `createdAt`.
- Render summary, CSS/SVG net-points bars, and chronological history.
- Clearly label fixture mode and live errors.

# Interfaces
Use `GoalSummary`, `GrowthResponse`, `getGrowthGoals`, `getGrowth`, and
`isFixtureMode` from `src/lib/ui-data.ts`.

# Output
`src/app/growth/page.tsx`

# Acceptance criteria
- The selected goal changes the chart and history together.
- Ended goals are read-only and labeled.
- No cross-goal aggregate is shown.
